</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</a>\n</nav>\n</div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"description-3\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div class=\"product-description j-product-description\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p><strong>Shimmer Body Lotion Highlighter Golden Glow SPF 25 </strong>is a combination of delicate care, a striking golden radiance, and sun protection.</p>\n<p>This shimmer body lotion is designed to enhance the skin's natural beauty, giving it a well-groomed look and a soft shimmering effect.</p>\n<p>Powered by <strong>SPF 25, </strong>this product helps protect the skin from the negative effects of sun rays when spending time outdoors. Its <strong>lightweight creamy texture</strong> distributes evenly over the body, absorbs quickly, and leaves no stickiness or greasy residue.</p>\n<p><strong>The formula is enriched with active ingredients </strong>that provide extra comfort and hydration.</p>\n<p><strong>Shea butter </strong>is known for its nourishing and softening properties. It helps make the skin smoother, supports its elasticity, and protects it from dryness.</p>\n<p><strong>D-panthenol</strong> promotes skin softening and supports its natural balance, helping to reduce the feeling of dryness.</p>\n<p><strong>Aloe vera extract</strong> is known for its moisturizing and soothing properties, helping to maintain a fresh and well-groomed appearance of the skin.</p>\n<p><strong>Food-grade glitters</strong> create a delicate golden shimmer, beautifully enhancing your tan and adding a natural glow effect.</p>\n<p>The lotion is perfect for the summer season, vacations, special occasions, or everyday use whenever you want to add definition and a beautiful shine to your skin.</p>\n<p><strong>Product Benefits:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>golden shimmer effect</li>\n<li>skin hydration and softening</li>\n<li>SPF 25</li>\n<li>lightweight texture without stickiness</li>\n<li>comfortable daily use</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Shimmer Body Lotion Highlighter Golden Glow SPF 25 — a simple way to add radiance and confidence to your skin every day.</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"reviews-3\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<section class=\"product-reviews\">\n<div class=\"reviews\" id=\"comments-container-uidb097983d94db5578616b010ff4fdebcd\">\n<div class=\"reviews__inner\">\n<div class=\"p-review\" id=\"uidb097983d94db5578616b010ff4fdebcd\">\n<div class=\"p-review__body\" itemprop=\"review\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Review\">\n<div class=\"p-review__header\">\n<div class=\"p-review__user\">\n<noindex>\n<a class=\"p-review-author p-review-author--guest\" itemprop=\"author\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Person\">\n<span class=\"p-review-author__photo\">\n</span>\n<span class=\"p-review-author__name\" itemprop=\"name\">\n                            Mary                        </span>\n</a>\n</noindex>\n<div class=\"p-review-meta\">\n<time class=\"p-review-meta__time\" datetime=\"2025-05-12T15:29:41+03:00\">\n<meta content=\"2025-05-12T15:29:41+03:00\" itemprop=\"datePublished\"/>\n                    12.05.2025 295 15:29                </time>\n<div class=\"p-review-meta__rating reviews-rating\">\n<div class=\"reviews-rating__star reviews-rating__star--active\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"reviews-rating__star reviews-rating__star--active\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"reviews-rating__star reviews-rating__star--active\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"reviews-rating__star reviews-rating__star--active\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"reviews-rating__star reviews-rating__star--active\">\n</div>\n</div>\n<div itemprop=\"reviewRating\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Rating\">\n<meta content=\"1\" itemprop=\"worstRating\"/>\n<meta content=\"5\" itemprop=\"ratingValue\"/>\n<meta content=\"5\" itemprop=\"bestRating\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div cla